{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_41524","headline":"寄韩侍郎 · 左偃","name":"寄韩侍郎","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"谋身谋隐两无成，拙计深慙负耦耕。\n渐老可堪怀故国，多愁翻觉厌浮生。\n言诗幸遇明公许，守朴甘遭俗者轻。\n今日况闻搜草泽，独悲顦顇卧昇平。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"左偃","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_41524.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_41524","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}